(a) previous build with an .ilean, reuse run writes one: kept 2; elabReasons {"text":1}; ilean equal to the fresh build's: true
(b) previous build without an .ilean, reuse run writes one: kept 0; elabReasons {"refs":2,"text":1}; ilean equal to the fresh build's: true
(c) neither writes an .ilean: kept 2; elabReasons {"text":1}
